Task: write the narrative parts of the data-reliability report from the section data provided (dataset summary, signal catalog summary, data-quality findings, trust verdicts, flags, patterns, diagnoses, assessor results, data-flow record). Operator-first: lead with what matters for running the plant (untrusted batches, active faults, affected signals), then the evidence, then the method. Every section body cites evidence IDs. Never add findings that are not in the artifacts. Keep numbers exactly as given.
